  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.1.38\n\n## Changes since v0.1.33\n\n- fix: list builds without waiting for project icon discovery (#46) (`d1c1afd`)\n- fix: prefer a single .slnx when a .sln sits next to it (#45) (`28a0679`)\n- fix: keep project edits made during a polling pass (#44) (`c8a5d37`)\n- Publish every packable project and verify NuGet availability after release (#42) (`5dfed56`)\n- Release with LF desktop file in the AppImage (`ff72d33`)\n",
